      "tiles": 3,
      "note": "MoveAidaMonsterVisual MODEL_WITCH_QUEEN (GMAida.cpp:489-494): AddTerrainLight at her feet in (0.7, 0.1, 0.1), radius 3, every frame. Ours: the aura laid on the ground under her root over MU`s 3 tiles, at the auras` faint 0.3."
    },
    "lands": {
      "key": 6,
      "note": "Ours: where her hit, the number and the sound, lands. MU shines at her target from AnimationFrame 6 of Attack 1 (8 keys) and runs its thunder to the target from 6 of Attack 2 (12 keys) (GMAida.cpp:765-788)."
    },
    "note": "MODEL_BLOODY_WITCH_QUEEN is MODEL_WITCH_QUEEN line for line in MuMain: the red terrain light (GMAida.cpp:517-522 = :489-494), the five hand and hair lights, the smoke, flashes and Attack 2's thunder at her target (:1237-1320 = the Witch Queen's), and Attack 2's BITMAP_JOINT_FORCE (:1500-1508 = :1464-1472), on the same 116-bone rig. So the Witch Queen's show, by her witch_queen tag (game/fx/witch_queen)."
  },
