    "note": "Resistance: OpenMU S6 Maps/Aida.cs writes 20/255 to poison and ice and 150/255 to fire for 552, read as WebZen raw values as the Witch Queen's are; fire is not carried. Drops: the Witch Queen's (Tarkan's 30 and 3, docs/worlds/aida-port.md decision 11); RegTime 10, OpenMU's RespawnDelay."
